    narr:narration """This narrative holds the deployment-gate decision as it was voiced and recorded on a single day. [The mandate that every deployment now requires a signed release manifest before it ships](narr:Expr_20261008_1_ProtectedBaseProbe_hfaec2f6da2c2_1) is the through-line, grounded in [the incident rationale — two unsigned artifacts reaching staging last quarter as the whole reason for the gate](narr:Expr_20261008_1_ProtectedBaseProbe_hfaec2f6da2c2_2). A decision register formalizes it in three entries: [the gate requirement itself](narr:Expr_20261008_1_ProtectedBaseProbe_hfaec2f6da2c2_3), [its scope across staging and production](narr:Expr_20261008_1_ProtectedBaseProbe_hfaec2f6da2c2_4), and [the named owner](narr:Expr_20261008_1_ProtectedBaseProbe_hfaec2f6da2c2_5). The register's formal, authority-ranked entries and the incident story's casual, communal retelling are two registers of the same decision, not competing ones.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261008_1_ProtectedBaseProbe_hfaec2f6da2c2_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261008_1_ProtectedBaseProbe_hfaec2f6da2c2_2> ;
